<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_EofVtde3C4BdQ486ug5omL519EsN" lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1wjzvi_w_58jv.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/41b5e_o-w2xun.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1cmnso0jnkwt6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2-k_577svdq9-.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-2l6qdc9b47pt9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/09nx881wbf89m.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><title>Blocks · MCPCN</title><meta name="description" content="React components and workflow blocks for human-controlled MCP Apps."/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.0-2l4nus4v8l3.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="site-nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">M</span>MCPCN</a><nav><a href="/docs">Docs</a><a href="/components">Components</a><a href="/blocks">Blocks</a><a href="/examples">Examples</a><a href="/playground">Playground</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/create">Create</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui" class="button">GitHub</a></div></header><main><span class="eyebrow">Complete patterns</span><h1>Workflow blocks</h1><p class="lede">Install the React UI, bound app, schemas, real MCP server recipe and runnable SQL fixture together.</p><p><a href="/docs/block-recipes">Connect a persistent block to your server</a></p><p><a href="/docs#install">Install the checked release packages and initialize your app</a> before adding a block.</p><div class="block-grid"><article class="catalog-card"><span>01</span><h3>review-before-action</h3><p>Review a planned external-state change before executing it.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">approval-card</span><span class="pill">diff-viewer</span><span class="pill">audit-trail</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy review-before-action installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="review-before-action installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add review-before-action</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>02</span><h3>collect-missing-data</h3><p>Ask only for fields an agent still needs.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">schema-form</span><span class="pill">missing-data-request</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy collect-missing-data installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="collect-missing-data installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add collect-missing-data</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>03</span><h3>extract-review-save</h3><p>Review extracted fields, evidence, and corrections before saving.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">extracted-fields-review</span><span class="pill">source-evidence-panel</span><span class="pill">approval-card</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy extract-review-save installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="extract-review-save installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add extract-review-save</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>04</span><h3>compare-options-approve</h3><p>Compare options with evidence and approve the final choice.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">comparison-matrix</span><span class="pill">score-breakdown</span><span class="pill">approval-card</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy compare-options-approve installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="compare-options-approve installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add compare-options-approve</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>05</span><h3>multi-step-tool-run</h3><p>Track a recoverable multi-step tool workflow.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">tool-progress-timeline</span><span class="pill">retryable-error-state</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy multi-step-tool-run installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="multi-step-tool-run installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add multi-step-tool-run</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>06</span><h3>approval-gated-tool-call</h3><p>Require explicit consent before an app-only tool call.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">destructive-action-guard</span><span class="pill">tool-call-card</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy approval-gated-tool-call installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="approval-gated-tool-call installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add approval-gated-tool-call</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>07</span><h3>human-corrects-ai-output</h3><p>Edit and validate structured agent output.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">inline-edit-form</span><span class="pill">validation-summary</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy human-corrects-ai-output installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="human-corrects-ai-output installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add human-corrects-ai-output</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>08</span><h3>agent-generated-report-review</h3><p>Review sources, conclusions, and publication intent.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">reasoning-summary</span><span class="pill">source-list</span><span class="pill">confirmation-panel</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy agent-generated-report-review installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="agent-generated-report-review installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add agent-generated-report-review</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>09</span><h3>file-upload-and-extract</h3><p>Review a file and its extracted structured content.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">file-review</span><span class="pill">document-preview</span><span class="pill">extracted-fields-review</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy file-upload-and-extract installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="file-upload-and-extract installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add file-upload-and-extract</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>10</span><h3>table-bulk-action-review</h3><p>Show affected rows and impact before a bulk action.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">entity-review-table</span><span class="pill">risk-review-panel</span><span class="pill">approval-card</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy table-bulk-action-review installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="table-bulk-action-review installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add table-bulk-action-review</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>11</span><h3>admin-change-review</h3><p>Review settings diffs, affected users, rollback, and approval.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">diff-viewer</span><span class="pill">data-access-notice</span><span class="pill">approval-card</span><span class="pill">audit-trail</span></div><div style="min-width:0"><button type="button" class="button secondary" aria-label="Copy admin-change-review installation">Copy command</button><pre class="code" tabindex="0" style="max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere" aria-label="admin-change-review installation"><code>node node_modules/mcpcn/dist/index.js add admin-change-review</code></pre><p class="mcpcn-hint" role="status">Review and run this in your existing app.</p></div><a href="/docs/block-recipes#recipes">Server, fixture, checks and preview</a></article></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer><div><strong>MCPCN</strong><p>Human control for agentic apps.</p></div><div><a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Security</a></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js" id="_R_" async